 things right it  really would be a ridiculously opie hulk  and to give you guys perspective  this goes way beyond heart of the  monster hulk way beyond that way beyond  herald of galactus hulk  this this turns hulk into a cosmic  entity but with that being said guys  we're gonna bring this video to an end  let me know down in the comments section  what video you want me to do next right  because we're kind of running out of  characters to do and honestly  i kind of like the idea of mashing up  characters that we don't normally get to  see right like  if we had franklin richards who got the  infinity gauntlet or if we had iron man  who had the power of the beyonders or  like if wolverine became the specter  from dc comics right we gotta learn to  think out of the box guys we gotta learn  to think out of the box  and make up our own stuff but anyway  yeah guys uh we're gonna bring this  video to an end thank you guys for  watching  and i will catch you all later  peace  [Music]  hey  [Music]  ah  bye

